        "Kangchenjunga (Sikkim) is the highest peak located entirely within India's controlled territory.",
        "Aravalli Range is recognized as one of the oldest fold mountain systems in the world.",
        "Key passes in the continuous Western Ghats: Thal Ghat, Bhor Ghat, and Pal Ghat.",
        "The confluence point of the Western Ghats and Eastern Ghats is the Nilgiri Hills."
